      "text": "Reminder Table \nReminder (Entity) | \nReminder_id (PK) \nUnit (time - sec, mins, hrs, days..) \nFrequency (a single value, or a list | csv)\nStart_time (ts)\nEnd_time (ts) \nStatus (enum - Not_started, Success, Failure, InProgress) \nReminder_count - Integer (1,2,3) \nSource (var_char) \nAction (notification, API call, web hook) | string \nMeta_info (related to action or source) \nResponse_output (optional - str)  \n",
